1296 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 521 0 R
/T (Under Doppler, the static delay-domain filter becomes inadequate because the channel varies within the OFDM symbol, creating inter-carrier interference. BEM models this time variation, and banded MMSE further mitigates the interference by accounting for coupling between subcarriers. It reduces BER from approximately 9.9% to 1.34%, although it remains above the ideal genie-MMSE benchmark.)
/E (Under Doppler, the static delay-domain filter becomes inadequate because the channel varies within the OFDM symbol, creating inter-carrier interference. BEM models this time variation, and banded MMSE further mitigates the interference by accounting for coupling between subcarriers. It reduces BER from approximately 9.9% to 1.34%, although it remains above the ideal genie-MMSE benchmark.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
