<<
/Title (Under Doppler, the static delay-domain filter becomes inadequate because the channel varies within the OFDM symbol, creating inter-carrier interference. BEM models this time variation, and banded MMSE further mitigates the interference by accounting for coupling between subcarriers. It reduces BER from approximately 9.9% to 1.34%, although it remains above the ideal genie-MMSE benchmark.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3621 0 R
/Prev 3636 0 R
>>
